                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " galata isaa deebise waan jed'e, AABBO Waaqi waan dansa, jaalalti inni worra Israeli jaalatu waan d'umatatiniti. Waan Mana AABBO Waaqa yayabanifi nami ch'ufti, haga dandau, lalabe AABBO Waaqa faarse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaaroleeni qaaloleetifi ta Lawitifi ta mata balbala gosa, ta Mana Waaqa ka duri kaani garte, Mana Waaqa ka yayabani arginaani mata qabate boote. Ammo worri achi jiru kaani ch'ufti aka male gammade qilit'ame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami dandae iyyaana bohatifi ta gammada gargari beekhu injiru, wonti akanatiifi iyyanti worraa sunini aka male guddate, fagole ch'ufa d'agayani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
